graphify-out/converted/behavior-spec_ed8c3838.md:32:| Sync Hook | SYNC-HOOK | As a game/app, I can sync localStorage state to DB after login. | Guests remain local; authenticated users fetch server state, wait for Zustand hydration, perform initial local/server sync, poll state every second, debounce saves, and use sendBeacon for pending unload saves. | Verified | Shares PROGRESS-APP merge semantics ambiguity. | Fixed in iteration 1 with PROGRESS-APP: shared sync hook no longer supplies untrusted Date.now() timestamps to progress save payloads. | Sync semantics bug | apps/web/src/shared/hooks/useAuthSync.ts | Fix source: apps/web/src/shared/hooks/useAuthSync.ts; apps/web/src/lib/__tests__/progress-merge.test.ts | Hook tests with mocked session/fetch/localStorage/timers/sendBeacon | Could direct Zustand subscription replace polling? | 1 | Iteration 1 static/fix/re-test tied to PROGRESS-APP: useAuthSync no longer sends localTimestamp Date.now() in save, beforeunload, or unmount beacon payloads; progress merge focused tests passed 2 tests; full Vitest passed 10 files / 72 tests; tsc --noEmit and eslint --quiet passed. | 2026-06-27 |
